	"data": "Calcifer Memory\n\nThe architecture behind Calcifer's persistent memory across sessions. Not a single system — a layered stack:\nVault notes (vault/) — canonical knowledge store. Atomic notes, projects, concepts, infra, people. The source of truth.\nDaily notes (vault/daily/) — auto-generated timestamped logs of events, decisions, and stewardship runs.\nCustom RAG (scripts/vault_rag.py) — Qdrant + qwen3-embedding + BM25 hybrid search over the vault. Falls back to BM25-only if Qdrant is down.…",
